sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant F as Day 22 fixtures
    participant C as Parity comparator
    participant P as PyTorch CUDA reference
    participant O as ONNXRuntimePolicy
    participant M as ONNX model

    F->>C: Load uint8 probe states
    F->>P: Load golden Q-values/actions
    C->>P: Verify hashes, shapes, and argmax actions
    C->>O: Request CPU or CUDA provider
    O->>O: Prepare BCHW float32 input
    O->>M: Run observation batch (N=1 or N=4)
    M-->>O: Return q_values (N,4)
    O-->>C: Return Q-values and shared argmax actions
    C->>C: Compare errors, margins, and agreement
